{"candidateAnswer":"Tupac and Dr. Dre","evidence":"[D20:8 | 8:57 pm on 22 September, 2023] Calvin: We used to rock a song by Tupac and Dr. Dre called \"California Love\". Ah, those were the days!\n[D20:6 | 8:57 pm on 22 September, 2023] Calvin: Yeah, there's this one song that always makes me smile. It played during a road trip with my dad and we had so much fun singing along to it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:686fb839-c3b4-57da-92ff-70d98126fc8f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:97cca61e43c10efc4705b9bf3b0ff511f165c2e73f8eda73d7333c961a8b146f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What was the artists Calvin used to listen to when he was a kid?","referenceAnswer":"Tupac and Dr. Dre","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"97cca61e43c10efc4705b9bf3b0ff511f165c2e73f8eda73d7333c961a8b146f"}}]}